  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e6be890c8a758f3488227c7687955d0c, type: 3}
  m_Name: M1R12
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TaleStoneData
  DialogueLines:
  - textVI: "Kh\xF4ng \u0111i qua gi\xF4ng b\xE3o, sao c\xF3 th\u1EC3 ch\u1EE9ng
      ki\u1EBFn c\u1EA7u v\u1ED3ng. H\u1EA1t B\u1ED5n Nguy\xEAn \u0111\xE3 ch\u1EA5p
      nh\u1EADn ng\u01B0\u01A1i. Mong r\u1EB1ng ng\u01B0\u01A1i s\u1EBD kh\xF4ng
      l\u1EA1c l\u1ED1i gi\u1EEFa nh\u1EEFng ng\xE3 r\u1EBD c\u1EE7a v\u1EADn m\u1EC7nh."
    textEN: Without walking through the storm, how can one witness the rainbow? The 
      Seed has accepted you. May you never lose your way amidst the crossroads of
      fate.
    AutoSkip: 0
  - textVI: "H\xE3y b\u01B0\u1EDBc \u0111i, v\xE0 t\xECm l\u1EA5y con \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng
      thu\u1ED9c v\u1EC1 ri\xEAng m\xECnh."
    textEN: Go forth, and find the path that belongs to you alone.
    AutoSkip: 0
  AutoProgressDelay: 1.5
  TypingSpeed: 0.05
  IsActivated: 1
